msgid "文本可视化"
msgstr "text visualization"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/text_visualization.rst:7
msgid "简介"
msgstr "Introduction"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/text_visualization.rst:9
msgid "在图像上叠加文本，支持静态文本、模板占位符和条件格式化，可用于状态提示、调试信息或结果标注。"
msgstr ""
"Overlay text on images, supporting static text, template placeholders and "
"conditional formatting, which can be used for status prompts, debugging "
"information or result annotations."

